id: camouflage
name: Camouflage
order: 6
description: >
  You possess, via some biological means, the ability to hide from predators and other dangers.
text: >
  Camouflage: You possess, via some biological means, the ability to hide from predators and other dangers.
  (1)-[1/Round]: Spend 1 Action and 8(bT) Ki Points to enter the Invisible Special State. You can exit the Invisible State at any time as an Instant Maneuver.
  (2)-[Automatic/Start of Turn]: If you are in the Invisible State due to the first effect of Camouflage, reduce your Ki Points by 6(bT).

---

# (1) Its own Maneuvers, on the Maneuvers tab (maneuvers/camouflage-*.dbu): in, 1 Action and 8(bT) Ki; out, as an Instant - its
# mark (Camouflaged) saying the Invisible State is Camouflage's.

# (2) Your turn begins Invisible by Camouflage: 6(bT) Ki Points.
[automatic/start-of-turn, effect 2]
requires inState("invisible") && hasCondition("camouflaged");
ki.value -= 6(bT);

# The Invisible State gone some other way: its mark with it.
[automatic/start-of-turn]
requires hasCondition("camouflaged") && !inState("invisible");
remove(camouflaged);
